## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to diagnose cross-region streaming backlogs with concrete knobs and safe rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Kafka/Flink backpressure and partition skew
- Parallelism tuning and fetch settings
- Safe rollback and validation against SLOs

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: monitor lag per partition
for (const tp of partitions) {
  const latest = endOffsets.get(tp);
  const consumed = consumerPosition(tp);
  const lag = latest - consumed;
}
```

